<div class="product__description rte quick-add-hidden" >
                    <p><em><strong>*DISCONTINUED*</strong></em></p>
<p>Mother Road Route 66 Root Beer captures a nostalgic, old-fashioned root beer essence. It starts with a sweet, creamy base infused with gentle spice notes—often reminiscent of wintergreen or sassafras—and finishes with a smooth vanilla undertone. Moderate carbonation adds a frothy head, delivering a balanced, classic flavor that evokes the spirit of the iconic highway.</p>
                  </div>
